#: src/sscview.cpp:279
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If you continue you will get access to the sample training despite not being "
"connected to the server.\n"
"\n"
"Because of this, ssc cannot make sure that the specified user exists. If it "
"does not you will run into trouble later.\n"
"\n"
"Only use this function if you really know what you are doing! It is also not "
"possible to use institution specific ids in offline mode."
msgstr ""
"Ako nastavite dobit ćete pristup treningu uzorka iako niste spojeni na "
"server.\n"
"\n"
"Zbog ovoga, ssc ne može sigurno utvrditi da navedeni korisnik postoji. Ako "
"ne postoji, poslije ćete upasti u nevolju.\n"
"\n"
"Koristite ovu funkciju samo ako zaista znate šta radite! Također, nije "
"moguće koristiti ustanovu navedenog ids u offline režimu rada."

